# Normalise to LF in the repository. Windows dev machines, Linux CI, and a
# separate Next.js frontend all read this tree; without this, checkout-time
# conversion produces CRLF shebangs that fail with "bad interpreter" and makes
# the mixed-line-ending pre-commit hook fight core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary

uv.lock linguist-generated=true
